# Keep hello.md current

`hello.md` is the living specification for DemoProject. Update it in the same change as any development or revision. Do not leave the doc behind the code.

## Update hello.md when any of these change

- Project overview, goals, or status
- Tech stack, dependencies, or scripts
- Folder layout, routing, or file conventions
- Configuration, environment variables, or request flow
- Features added, removed, or moved in or out of scope

## How to update

- Edit the affected sections so they match the project after the change.
- Add one row to the revision history table: date and what changed.
- Describe only what is true now. Remove steps, folders, and tools that no longer exist.

```markdown
| 2026-11-09 | Add app/settings route and document it under Project structure |
```
